.TH SANCHALA-LOGIN-SETTINGS 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-login-settings \- Login screen (SDDM) configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-login-settings
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure the login screen theme, auto-login, and user list.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show current settings
.TP
.B theme \fIname\fR
Set login theme
.TP
.B autologin \fIuser\fR
Enable auto-login for user
.TP
.B autologin off
Disable auto-login
.TP
.B userlist \fIon|off\fR
Show/hide user list
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-login-settings theme breeze
.TP
sanchala-login-settings autologin john
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
